<li class="link edit_tags"><a href="https://www.dreamwidth.org/edittags?journal=transitional_writes&amp;itemid=46365" ><img border='0' width="16" height="16" alt="Edit Tags" title="Edit Tags" src="//www.dreamwidth.org/img/silk/entry/tag_edit.png"  /></a></li>
